<title>ROMANIA: Romania February unemployment 7.1 pct vs 6.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Romania February unemployment 7.1 pct vs 6.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's unemployment rate rose to 7.1 percent in February from 6.7 percent the previous month, the Labour Ministry reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Ministry officials explained the rise by slackening activities in the construction and farming sectors in winter.</p>
<p>				  FEBRUARY   JANUARY   FEB 1996</p>
<p> Number unemployed	  748,115    702,537   1.055 million</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	    7.1	    6.7	9.4 NOTE -</p>
<p>Romania's workforce is 10.491 million.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
